<title>LATVIA: SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT LATVIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND BEAT LATVIA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotland beat Latvia 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup group four qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: John Collins (18th min), Darren Jackson (77th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 9,500  </p>
<p>Group four standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Sweden	2   2   0   0   7   2    6</p>
<p> Scotland    2   1   1   0   2   0    4</p>
<p> Estonia     2   1   0   1   1   1    3</p>
<p> Belarus     3   1   0   2   2   6    3</p>
<p> Austria     1   0   1   0   0   0    1</p>
<p> Latvia	2   0   0   2   1   4    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Oct 9  - Sweden v Austria, Estonia v Scotland,</p>
<p>Belarus v Latvia</p>
</text>
